Scraping Attempts Summary
1. Local Attempts (Python + Playwright)
Initial attempts were made using local Playwright scripts, which failed due to infrastructure issues:

Network errors such as ERR_NAME_NOT_RESOLVED and ERR_CONNECTION_TIMED_OUT.

Connectivity problems attributed to unstable work Wi-Fi or local DNS blocks.

2. External APIs & Cloud Solutions
Attempts to bypass local issues using managed services:

Used WebScraping.ai and Firecrawl.

Tried using browserless.io.

The Result: All these services failed due to geographic blocking (selective DNS) by the website for IP addresses outside of Israel.

3. The Successful Solution
Setting up a Browserless server on a Google Cloud instance with an Israeli IP address. This setup provided stable access and successfully bypassed all regional restrictions.
